{
    "title": "GPS, Maps & Driving Directions",
    "description": "Navigate with Ease using GPS, Traffic, & Voice Guidance. Go anywhere confidently with GPS, Maps & Driving Directions app.\r\n\r\n<b>GPS Maps & Directions:</b> Find your way with turn-by-turn navigation for driving, walking, cycling & more. \r\n<b>Beat the Traffic:</b> Real-time traffic alerts & alternate routes for faster travel. \r\n<b>Traffic Alerts:</b> Real-time traffic notifications that inform drivers about traffic congestion, accidents, road closures, and other incidents that may impact their commute. These alerts can help drivers avoid delays, choose alternative routes, Detours and plan their trips more efficiently.\r\n<b>Voice Navigation:</b> Provides turn-by-turn instructions through voice prompts. This allows drivers to keep their eyes on the road and focus on driving safely.\r\n<b>Plan Your Trip:</b> Live weather updates keep you prepared.\r\n<b>Points of interest (POI) search:</b> You can search for nearby restaurants, gas stations, and other points of interest using voice commands.\r\n\r\nDownload GPS, Maps & Driving Directions today and navigate smarter, not harder!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Navigate with Ease using GPS, Traffic, &amp; Voice Guidance. Go anywhere confidently with GPS, Maps &amp; Driving Directions app.<br><br><b>GPS Maps &amp; Directions:</b> Find your way with turn-by-turn navigation for driving, walking, cycling &amp; more. <br><b>Beat the Traffic:</b> Real-time traffic alerts &amp; alternate routes for faster travel. <br><b>Traffic Alerts:</b> Real-time traffic notifications that inform drivers about traffic congestion, accidents, road closures, and other incidents that may impact their commute. These alerts can help drivers avoid delays, choose alternative routes, Detours and plan their trips more efficiently.<br><b>Voice Navigation:</b> Provides turn-by-turn instructions through voice prompts. This allows drivers to keep their eyes on the road and focus on driving safely.<br><b>Plan Your Trip:</b> Live weather updates keep you prepared.<br><b>Points of interest (POI) search:</b> You can search for nearby restaurants, gas stations, and other points of interest using voice commands.<br><br>Download GPS, Maps &amp; Driving Directions today and navigate smarter, not harder!",
